  "description": "Given a reference of a node in a connected undirected graph, return a deep copy (clone) of the graph.",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "1. map = new Map();\n2. function clone(node) {\n3.   if (!node) return null;\n4.   if (map.has(node)) return map.get(node);\n5.   let copy = new Node(node.val);\n6.   map.set(node, copy);\n7.   for (let neighbor of node.neighbors) {\n8.     copy.neighbors.push(clone(neighbor));\n9.   }\n10.  return copy;\n11. }",
